ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkuhn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkuhn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkuhn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkuhn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkuhn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkuhn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkuhn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-03-15T00:03:43Z","updated_at":"2019-03-15T00:03:43Z","body":"Just a reminder that this will need to be marked for a later release, given that this issue is intimately tied #655 which is now marked for \"Later Release\".  I'd suggest keeping this Issue and #655 in the same state in tandem, since obviously if one of them is added to the SPDX license list, the other one should be, for parity since they are so similar, as @jlovejoy [pointed out in the other issue](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/655#issuecomment-397696797).  ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/473110533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/473132166","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/714#issuecomment-473132166","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/714","id":473132166,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ3MzEzMjE2Ng==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.githu